sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer
    participant EmailProcessor as Email Processing
    participant Classifier as Ai Classification
    participant Router as Routing
    participant Agent as Promo Code Agent
    participant WooCommerce as WooCommerce
    participant AiAssistant as Ai Assistant
    participant Approver as Approval Queue
    participant Responder as Response System

    Note over Customer,Responder: Email Processing (Promo Code Agent)

    Customer->>EmailProcessor: Send Email (Discount/Promo Inquiry)
    EmailProcessor->>EmailProcessor: Receive via Gmail Push/Sync/Manual
    EmailProcessor->>Classifier: Extract & Normalize Content
    Classifier->>Classifier: Run GPT-4o Classification (discount_inquiries/promo_refund + Confidence)
    Classifier->>Classifier: Run Amazon Comprehend Sentiment Analysis
    Classifier->>Classifier: Retrieve Full Thread History
    Classifier->>Router: Classified Email
    Router->>Agent: Route to Promo Code Agent (if confidence >=60%)
    alt Confidence <60% or Escalation Needed
        Router->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
    end
    Agent->>WooCommerce: Retrieve Customer Order History
    Agent->>Agent: Classify Customer (First-time/Returning/VIP)
    Agent->>Agent: Lookup Active Promo Configs (isActive, eligibleForAutomation)
    alt PromoCodeService (discount_inquiries)
        Agent->>Agent: Evaluate Eligibility (First-time/General/Loyalty Rules)
        alt Eligible
            Agent->>Agent: Select Promo Code (First-time/General/Loyalty)
        else Not Eligible
            Agent->>Responder: Decline Email (Suggest Alternatives)
        end
    else EnhancedPromoRefundService (promo_refund)
        Agent->>Agent: AI Code Extraction & Request Classification
        alt Explicit Discount
            Agent->>Agent: Provide Available Promo Code
        else Specific Code Problem
            Agent->>Agent: Lookup Code & Troubleshoot
            alt Code Not Found
                Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
            end
        else Vague Issue
            Agent->>Responder: Clarification Email
        else Unknown
            Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate to Ai Assistant
        end
    end
    alt Automation Approval Required
        Agent->>Approver: Queue for Review (Customer Context, Eligibility, Proposed Code)
        Approver->>Responder: Approve & Proceed
    end
    Responder->>Customer: Send Response (Promo Code/Decline/Clarification)
    Note over Agent,Responder: Log Steps, Track Metrics
    alt Errors (Config, No Data, Abuse Detected)
        Agent->>AiAssistant: Escalate with Priority
        Agent->>Customer: Notify Error/Service Unavailable
    end
